      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Mobs killed by a player sometimes drop rare items. Most of them are §6armor modifications§r for the §3Armor Modification Table§r.\n\n- §6Bottle of Spider Milk§r - spiders, 1 in 500. Removes bad potion effects.\n- §6Serum§r - cave spiders, 1 in 100. Turns poison into strength.\n- §6Velvet Band-Aid§r - animals, 1 in 500. 3% chance to fully heal you when you take damage.\n- §6VT-40§r - Cyber Crabs, 1 in 500. Cuts armor wear by 80% and adds 2 health.\n- §6Heart Piece§r - any hostile mob, 1 in 1000. Adds 2.5 hearts. Four of them, four aluminium ingots and a Creeper coin make a §6Heart Container§r.\n- §6Cracked Key§r - hostile mobs, 1 in 250. Opens a red keyhole once, then breaks.\n- §6Silo Launch Code Piece§r - hostile mobs, 1 in 250. Eight of them and an advanced circuit make a §6Silo Launch Code§r.\n\nZombies also drop the odd copper, aluminium or titanium ingot, and villagers drop flesh. Several of these items can also be found in dungeon and mineshaft chests.",
